**PR Title:** `perf(storage): compress DAG-CBOR blocks with zstd`
**Motivation:** Compress serialized CBOR byte vectors with zstandard level 3 to minimize disk footprint.

```rust
// APPROVED: Compresses CBOR payloads with Zstd before hashing to reduce network bandwidth.
pub fn encode_and_compress<T: Serialize>(val: &T) -> Result<(Vec<u8>, BlockId), CodecError> {
    let cbor = to_canonical_cbor(val)?;
    let comp = zstd::encode_all(&cbor[..], 3)?;
    let cid = BlockId::from_sha256(&Sha256::digest(&comp));
    Ok((comp, cid))
}
```

